# oc-sim scenario v1
# An input port reading another app's output (journal/D-048): launch RATCHET
# in the first slot (the menu, three detents down), step the focus to the
# second slot with a short press of down, open the menu there (on NOTHING),
# pick the SEQUENCE column with the left encoder and launch MELODY. Hold up
# for a second: MELODY's routing page. Pick CLOCK (four detents of the left
# encoder, past its four outputs) and turn it four detents: past TR2 to TR4,
# to RATCHET's THRU. Then three clocks on TR1, which RATCHET copies to THRU.
# The snapshot shows the routing page, CLOCK reading 1:THRU.
ticks 2100
20  button up down
60  button down down
70  button up up
70  button down up
90  button down down
100 button down up
110 button down down
120 button down up
130 button down down
140 button down up
160 button right down
166 button right up
220 button down down
226 button down up
300 button up down
340 button down down
350 button up up
350 button down up
380 encoder 1 -1
400 button right down
406 button right up
450 button up down
1500 button up up
1520 encoder 1 +4
1540 encoder 2 +4
1700 trigger 1 high
1705 trigger 1 low
1800 trigger 1 high
1805 trigger 1 low
1900 trigger 1 high
1905 trigger 1 low
